  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **band intro & interview**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2001-10-22.kcrw.fm.flac16** (recommended): FM broadcast; 7 songs; 38 min [1]. Said about its sound: Very low-generation copy, but FM noise runs throughout, mostly in the talking and silent stretches [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: DJ [1]\n- The band's first appearance on KCRW's Morning Becomes Eclectic, broadcast live from Santa Monica [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2001-10-22.kcrw.fm.flac16**: taped by Scott E.; transferred by Magnix; source: FM > ? > CD-R [1]. Also: Taken from the radio broadcast, copied to CD-R, then converted with EAC to FLAC. Uploader got the CD-R in April 2002 from the taper [1]",
